  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN SDG Action Campaign Strateg-UNDP-HQ-00113414</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN SDG Action Campaign Strategy aimed at:1) Scaling up engagement, action and mobilization for the SDGs.2) Deepen outreach and SDSG engagement within the creative sector.3) Connecting people&#x2019;s perceptions and actions on the SDGs with decision makers.4) Support local and regional governments efforts to implement the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
